# Career history index

> Maintained by the career-historian skill at the end of every session — one line per employer. This file always lives in the working folder even when dossiers live elsewhere (e.g. a notes vault over MCP): it's what resume-tailor's freshness check sees, so touching it is how new history becomes discoverable to tailoring runs.

